($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13841880, $f$i can't get the balance right$f$, ARRAY[$f$LuckyDiceKirby$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Outsider tilts his head. “Are you angry, Corvo?”Corvo thinks that the Outsider, if he was the kind of person that could get scabs, would probably be the sort to pick at them. “Let’s see. I don’t know. What do I have to be angry about? That someone with your Mark killed Jessamine? That you gave me these powers and let me run around this entire city like a rat in a maze, because you wanted to see what would happen? Because you couldn’t bring yourself to leave Jessamine alone, even in death?”$f$, 2048, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-25T03:50:46.587+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-25T03:50:46.683+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
