($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13889736, $f$How sweet the sound$f$, ARRAY[$f$ChiaWrites$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$'Ever since Lucille had mentioned singing a solo in Church, Valerie had been curious to hear what she sounded like.'$f$, 1019, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-01T20:24:42.454+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T20:24:42.455+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13889919, $f$Drink In The Golden Hour$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Corvo didn't have a chance to rest for months after restoring Emily to the throne. It is on the beach, fingers deep in sand grains and sunlight kissing his face, that he relaxes. But it is not just sunlight that kisses him...$f$, 895, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-08T09:52:19.445+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-08T09:52:19.530+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13962771, $f$242. Starry Night$f$, ARRAY[$f$tveckling$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Corvo wasn't expecting any company when he came up to the roof. It was a place he usually came to when he wanted to be alone and as far as he was aware no one else knew that the secret passage even existed. But then, the Outsider wasn't any normal person. Of course he knew.$f$, 1353, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-13T16:30:44.953+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-13T16:30:45.019+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13983006, $f$253. Called Out in the Dark$f$, ARRAY[$f$tveckling$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2018-08-25T13:41:35.723+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-25T13:41:35.775+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13985661, $f$Stargazers$f$, ARRAY[$f$NowSeeHere$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Fresh out of the Army, Valerie Dyer is at a loss of what to do with herself. Uncertain with her future, she falls into a habit of drinking and feeling sorry for herself until a cute librarian with a smile so sweet it could make the flowers grow gives her some motivation and a reason to get out of bed everyday and do something with her life.Lucille x Valerie, with eventual Delia x Patsy and Trixie x Barbara in later chapters. Modern-Era, Non-Canon, Valerie's POV. Updates Fridays.   Special Pupcake Only Chapters 11 and 12!$f$, 166687, 18, 18, true, -1, false, $f$2019-06-04T11:51:04.737+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-04T11:51:04.806+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13997727, $f$A Lesson in Fear  Love.$f$, ARRAY[$f$happinessfordeeppeople (Aura0190)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Post DOTO. The Outsider is a tad scared of facing Corvo as a human. Billie is done with all this pining. And Emily totally ships them.$f$, 2696, 2, 2, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-25T03:50:30.685+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-25T03:50:30.830+00:00$f$, $f$2018-03-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
