($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14198790, $f$A Bride Most Scandalous$f$, ARRAY[$f$Devin Cage (shiny_silver_socks)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$At the request of his beloved twin sister, Frederick Avington agrees to wear a wedding dress and pose as fiancée to Lord Montcroix. It's only supposed to be a distraction, to allow her the time she needs to elope with her lover, but before he can stop it, he finds himself legally Baroness Montcroix. William Montcroix, newly titled and back in England after spending years fighting Napoleon's forces, has resigned himself to a loveless marriage with a woman he's never met. But the woman to whom he finds himself married isn't a woman at all--and he can't say he minds.$f$, 8749, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-06-11T02:41:32.748+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-11T02:41:33.210+00:00$f$, $f$2018-04-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
