($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14256669, $f$The Void Is Empty And The God Is Here$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What if Corvo Attano has kept the Twin-Bladed knife when it fell to his possession in Dunwall some years ago? What if it is at his hand that the Eyeless and the Envisioned fall? And what if begging Daud to whisper the Outsider's name is Corvo's priority, as well as to hold the said god, now freed, in his arms?$f$, 2839, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-05-02T05:34:24.547+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-02T05:34:24.621+00:00$f$, $f$2018-04-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
