($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14406567, $f$Blood Relations$f$, ARRAY[$f$BlatantlyQueer$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$悪魔城ドラキュラX 月下の夜想曲 | Castlevania: Symphony of the Night$f$, $f$悪魔城伝説 | Castlevania lll: Dracula's Curse$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Richter follows Alucard into the inverted Castlevania, determined to make up for the trouble he caused. Alucard can't help but be reminded of someone he loved over 300 years ago.-In which Alucard is depressed and melodramatic, Richter is a chaotic bisexual, and I neglect Maria almost entirely. Sorry, girl. :(None of the angst has to do with gender dysphoria or being trans.*$f$, 9438, 9, 9, true, -1, false, $f$2018-11-17T12:45:59.051+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-17T12:45:59.095+00:00$f$, $f$2018-04-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14422038, $f$自深深处   (De Profundis）$f$, ARRAY[$f$mortalcat$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$如果比利勒克没能找到第二种方法，但仍然给予了界外人他想要的完结。而神明没有忘记留下一份临别礼物，给他最偏爱的。$f$, 6352, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-01T11:34:34.419+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T11:34:34.525+00:00$f$, $f$2018-04-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14422371, $f$De Profundis$f$, ARRAY[$f$mortalcat$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In which Billie Lurk failed to find the other option, yet still gave the outsider the end he’d been hoping for. And the deity did not forget to leave a gift to his favourite.$f$, 4694, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-02T14:12:33.762+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-02T14:12:33.882+00:00$f$, $f$2018-04-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
