($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14536281, $f$The Craving for Salt$f$, ARRAY[$f$CoffeeWithConsequences$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The trouble with a long-term lie, or even a long-term omission, is that if you can’t make it true to yourself, you will eventually forget to make it true to someone else. Lying and omission were Daniel’s bread and butter, but when he was with Archie, he wasn’t at work (mostly). And so, eventually, he forgot.
 After hiding it from Archie for months, Daniel finally comes clean about something he's been hiding.$f$, 3074, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-06-11T02:41:13.860+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-11T02:41:14.280+00:00$f$, $f$2018-05-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
