($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14836205, $f$A God to a Deity, Turned Human$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$How many futures and pasts and presents does the Outsider see? The god barely knows himself, watching it all move and blind him for millennia. But there are some possibilities that draw his attention.
Especially one, where his eyes are not black. But Corvo's are.$f$, 1536, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:32:25.451+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:32:25.487+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14880717, $f$To Catch A Countess$f$, ARRAY[$f$Devin Cage (shiny_silver_socks)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Without striking beauty or an aristocratic bloodline, Miss Prudence Copeland is hardly the talk of London, but her substantial dowry means her debut Season will likely be her last.Lady Charlotte, Countess of Ashbridge, is just fine with that outcome--as long as the suitor Prudence agrees to wed is her.$f$, 5993, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-01-22T23:12:10.777+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-22T23:12:10.933+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
