($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14912492, $f$Brown Eyed Girl$f$, ARRAY[$f$addledwalrus$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Patricia's life as a sheltered rich girl and eventual falling out with her parents.$f$, 10863, 15, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-01-23T06:03:52.763+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T06:03:52.841+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14915756, $f$A View From the Outside$f$, ARRAY[$f$Crowkidart$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 3872, 2, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-06-06T08:34:14.208+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-06T08:34:14.310+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14954729, $f$run to your mama$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There was no way of getting around it, and even Koichi, who was able to see the good in almost everyone, would agree that, honestly, Kishibe Rohan belonged in a trash-heap of humanity, along with bits of orange peel and old porn magazines. That didn’t take away from the fact that Rohan was also … hot, or that Josuke’s adolescent mind was consumed with the desire to have Rohan, whatever that meant.$f$, 5474, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-05-27T13:53:58.618+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-27T13:53:58.938+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14962995, $f$Prologue - The Weapon Maker's Son$f$, ARRAY[$f$Politzania$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Marvel Cinematic Universe$f$, $f$Iron Man (Movies)$f$, $f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Once upon a time,  a man who had everything wanted more.     He took a wife,  a lovely, talented young woman who he bent to his will.   In time,  she bore her husband a son and named him Antonio.   A brilliant, strong-willed child, Antonio could stand in his father's shadow only so long. Written for  Square K5 -  Fairy-tale style narration$f$, 617, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2018-12-28T18:11:54.148+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-28T18:11:54.206+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 14968079, $f$The Duke's Spiderling$f$, ARRAY[$f$Prinzenhasserin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Locke Lamora, orphan from the Catchfire, gets adopted by Don and Doña Vorchenza. As a consequence, his meeting with Jean Tannen is much different.$f$, 11732, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-08-07T22:22:53.722+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-07T22:22:53.978+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15001163, $f$Hair$f$, ARRAY[$f$quinngrey$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In which Finrod admits his adoration for Beor's body hair and they make love.$f$, 1472, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-31T11:48:00.063+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T11:48:00.133+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15031187, $f$Molded By His Hands$f$, ARRAY[$f$Cannibal_Wings$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$To wear the Mark of the Outsider is more than just baring a brand. It is a contract, an agreement, to give yourself fully to the God of the Void. The Outsider is a deity but he also considers himself an artist. The bodies of his Marked are his canvas to sculpt into something new and something better.$f$, 2315, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-08T22:36:59.609+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-08T22:36:59.736+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15032300, $f$play the way you feel$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Rohan has never liked Josuke, and he never will, not when Josuke comes to confess his feelings to him (a trick), not when he keeps seeing him everywhere (the work of an enemy stand) and not even when Josuke is nowhere to be found, except in Rohan's own mind (this is Josuke's fault somehow.)$f$, 2395, 1, 3, false, 5, false, $f$2019-06-08T03:24:04.160+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-08T03:24:04.343+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15037121, $f$Transmutation$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sometimes a story is simply a story. And two men with tragic pasts, which would have run the world, are simply the storytellers. The world doesn’t always need heroics, for its carcass is the intimate connection between people. And if one is made of wire and metal and another of flesh and bone, what does it matter?
   Truly, it matters not.A story where the Outsider is an android and Corvo is a man with a tragic past. How is this going to work?$f$, 9276, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:32:08.116+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:32:08.163+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
