($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15181142, $f$never have i ever$f$, ARRAY[$f$aquilaofarkham$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Castlevania (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$During their stay at a crowded inn, Trevor and Alucard decide to play a game of “never have I ever” to pass the time while also getting to know each other more intimately.$f$, 3365, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2018-11-17T12:45:50.990+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-17T12:45:51.049+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15189647, $f$Rock You Like a Hurricane$f$, ARRAY[$f$Caesarino_Zeppeli$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2018-07-13T11:02:17.873+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-13T11:02:18.003+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15194984, $f$the passenger$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$, $f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Ten years after the events of Vento Aureo, Giorno has become the gangstar he's always wanted to be. But when it comes to being lucky, he's cursed.$f$, 5184, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-23T03:02:29.985+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T03:02:30.237+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15272793, $f$brute divine$f$, ARRAY[$f$celoica$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He was clean, unmarred by the passing of time, by the sharp edges of knives and swords and brutal fists. Cut from virgin cloth, swathed in it.The Outsider paused. That wasn't right. There, in the eyes, dark and heavy from above the black mask obscuring his nose and eyes. There, in the slope of his shoulders, the crouched position he took on the top of the bell tower, the tight scrape of his hair pulled back from his face.There, on the scar blotting his left hand, a shape the Outsider was intimately familiar with.The boy raised his head, moonlight cutting across his face. He slipped two fingers under the fabric across his face, pulling it free. It settled around his throat like a collar. The Outsider wondered what sort of god possessed the kind of power to give a man like Corvo Attano a second life.$f$, 3926, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:32:01.354+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:32:01.426+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15276135, $f$The Catchfire Days$f$, ARRAY[$f$MEVaughan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Post-The Republic of Thieves.On the road to Emberlain, Locke Lamora is struck down by a freak bolt of lightning, during a storm. Almost twenty-five years previous, Lamor Acanthus steps onto the shores of Catchfire, drunk and grief-stricken, and has an unfortunate run-in with a grubby orphan boy who will change everything.------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------Triggered by the lightening, Locke recovers his lost memories of Catchfire, but is rendered comatose. Jean and Sabetha struggle to keep him alive, and deal with the reality that this may finally be it for the infamous Locke Lamora.Hurt/Comfort, friendship drama, with love and plenty of fretting from Sabetha and Jean, and new take on Lamor. COMPLETE!$f$, 29959, 16, 16, true, 1, false, $f$2018-12-27T10:38:12.740+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-27T10:38:12.817+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
