($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15346227, $f$Knowledges$f$, ARRAY[$f$imperfectkreis$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2018-07-20T02:31:24.398+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-20T02:31:24.402+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15354750, $f$Despite the Warning Signs$f$, ARRAY[$f$ExtraPenguin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When his father brings him to Koi Tower to learn cultivation, Mo Xuanyu is more than a bit lost amongst the disciples who've been here since the age of 6. Luckily for him, though, there's another youth in a similar situation - and he's really cool and only a few years Mo Xuanyu's senior as well! Thus starts operation "seduce Xue Yang". Thankfully, Mo Xuanyu doesn't seem to have much competition.$f$, 9846, 2, 2, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-05T22:32:07.810+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-05T22:32:07.859+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15383193, $f$Unable To Stay Away$f$, ARRAY[$f$Waterrain$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$AU: ABO Verse. 15 Year Old Omega!Wei WuXian (wears a ring which masks his scent into smelling like an Alpha) and Alpha!Jiang Cheng go to visit the Cloud Recesses for a year. Wei WuXian at the Lotus Pier does not wear a ring to cover his scent up, but Jiang Fengmian informed him the ring must be worn or else he won't be able to go with Jiang Cheng to the Cloud Recesses. At the Cloud Recesses there is an handsome and cold Alpha known to be able to resist any Omega in heat with ease. (I have a Sequel for Unable To Stay Away and it is named Let's Always Be Together)$f$, 22571, 15, 15, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:41:00.165+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:41:00.191+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15388446, $f$The Bed Warmer$f$, ARRAY[$f$Pixel_Runner$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$teratophilia - Fandom$f$, $f$naga - Fandom$f$, $f$Monsters - Fandom$f$, $f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, 16366, 8, 8, true, -1, false, $f$2019-01-23T06:06:36.708+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T06:06:36.768+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15457371, $f$Resurrection$f$, ARRAY[$f$MildredMost$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He pulled a handkerchief from his pocket. Something fell out of it and skittered across the floor. “You…” Edward hesitated to ask. “You make a habit of carrying teeth in your pocket?”John glanced down at the tooth lying there. “Worth a shilling, that,” he said. “Always got a couple about my person in case of need.”Edward swallowed. John grinned and kissed him. Edward wondered how he could want a man who carried human teeth in his pocket like loose change.$f$, 7653, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-01-24T00:08:57.656+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-24T00:08:58.115+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15473271, $f$A set of Knives and A basket filled with Fluff$f$, ARRAY[$f$Alkie$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Word prompts drabbles and stories that are one-shots(I won't be writing for mdzs anymore,  thank you for supporting me tho)$f$, 61463, 105, 105, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-22T17:50:09.573+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T17:50:09.591+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15478464, $f$The Valiant$f$, ARRAY[$f$Delusional_Lunatic_3791$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$The Incredibles (2004)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The superheroes are gone. Society has moved on without them. Yet, Findekáno isn't quite ready to hang up the cape. When he receives an offer he can't refuse, he takes it—but at the possible expense of the family he loves the most.$f$, 28148, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-07-31T11:05:23.490+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T11:05:23.560+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15531777, $f$just with a touch of your lips$f$, ARRAY[$f$erlkoenig$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$TOLKIEN J. R. R. - Works & Related Fandoms$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Balan scowls, and feels more than hears the next, I have no idea what you are saying.
“Yes well, that makes two of us.”$f$, 1298, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-31T11:43:54.132+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T11:43:54.193+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15534774, $f$water trade$f$, ARRAY[$f$kichiya$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Lianhua Village was known for it's reputation of housing the most prestigious geisha houses in the country. When Lan Wangji accompanied his father to meet the main lady of the Jiangs, he did not think that she housed geishas. Nor did he think he would fall in love with one.$f$, 20039, 7, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:39:52.141+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:39:52.158+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15545328, $f$lay me down tonight in my diamonds and pearls$f$, ARRAY[$f$erlkoenig$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$TOLKIEN J. R. R. - Works & Related Fandoms$f$, $f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Here they are Balan and Nom; here, he does not have to carry the weight of an entire people$f$, 884, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-31T03:36:10.871+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T03:36:10.961+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15548160, $f$Reading Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$, ARRAY[$f$Athane$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After everything happened, there are still questions unanswered and some things unresolved, luckily a certain creature felt the need to share the story seen though the eyes of Wei WuXian.I suck at summaries and own no rights to Mo Dao Zu Shi.Rated M for the violence in the story. First time writing a story so no flames please.$f$, 114150, 37, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-22T17:49:39.454+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T17:49:39.466+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15559011, $f$Cradle Songs of Comfort and Bones Gnawed By Teeth$f$, ARRAY[$f$etheratisha$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There’s an old woman on her balcony, tossing her things into the street. For a moment he sees the face of a beautiful young woman, but it is only a short moment, and she is nothing but an old woman once again. Old Granny Rags smiles at him with teeth that are at once perfectly straight and white and sharp, but yet also yellowed and crooked and dull.$f$, 3483, 3, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-05-01T11:30:49.401+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T11:30:49.449+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15571509, $f$Affection$f$, ARRAY[$f$Waterrain$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian was picked up, but Jiang Fengmian intentions were not pure and certainly was not noble. It wasn't until later it was discovered the real reason why Wei Wuxian was taken home to Jiang Fengmian's household. Jiang Fengmian's biggest mistakes was allowing Wei Wuxian to visit and learn at the Cloud Recesses.$f$, 17543, 10, 10, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:49:48.301+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:49:48.326+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15609840, $f$when you catch me wide awake$f$, ARRAY[$f$erlkoenig$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$TOLKIEN J. R. R. - Works & Related Fandoms$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The golden light seemed more beautiful now, lighting over the curve of muscle under dark skin, a dusting of sweat, barely there in the still cool morning air.“Are you enjoying the view, my lord?”$f$, 995, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-31T11:39:59.462+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T11:39:59.509+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15630330, $f$The Devil's Favour$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Oh, my Adeline, oohDown in TasmaniaWhere the devil's jaws are far too weakTo tear you away
Feared is the sea devil, lurking in the deep dark. Feared is his religion and his mark. But what is truly known about the creature that rules the ocean and the whales and the tides?There is one man in the world of today that is lucky enough to learn the secrets of the devil. But to learn those secrets, he must learn to play a game that rules a different world altogether - the Empire, run by social sharks, dangerous enough to match the dangers of the sea.$f$, 28780, 7, 7, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-30T03:28:27.195+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T03:28:27.282+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15634254, $f$fever running through our veins$f$, ARRAY[$f$erlkoenig$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$TOLKIEN J. R. R. - Works & Related Fandoms$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“I promise you, I cannot see a thing. What sort of knots are these?” He pulls again, the rope rubbing and chafing his wrists already. “They are quite sturdy and — you’re making a rude gesture at me, aren’t you.”$f$, 1518, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-30T03:38:31.980+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-30T03:38:32.038+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15654606, $f$A Good Show$f$, ARRAY[$f$ilcuoreardendo$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He watches the Outsider detach from the shadows, pale hands reaching for Corvo. Daud should have known. There was something about Corvo that was fascinating. It only stood to reason the Outsider would see that as well.


  “Corvo.” The Outsider’s voice is crashing waves and whale song, sonorous and somber, reverberating throughout the room and rattling inside Daud’s bones.$f$, 440, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-30T21:27:37.766+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T21:27:37.867+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15671841, $f$Better the Demon You Know$f$, ARRAY[$f$MEOWMIAO$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$The Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù - All Media$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$WARNING: The story starts at the backstory, so it doesn’t immediately jump into the story described above. Sorry about any confusion! >.<Wei Wuxian and his beloved Lan Wangji were once together and happy. An incident that occurred when Lan Wangji was not at home caused a huge catastrophe to sweep through the busy town. Now:A demon demands a sacrifice each year on October 31st. Conditions: the sacrifice must be betrothed or in love. This year, a young girl by the name of Jiang Yanli, betrothed to the Jin family's young master was chosen. However, someone steps in at the last moment...Rated E for later chapters :3Tags will be added later as I write each chapter.At first this fic was just a jumble of ideas to make LWJ and WWX have hot and kinky sex together. Later, something resembling a backstory was pieced together and now we're here... Inspired by ideas by Rurella and Lazylurker (the main people) and a bunch of other peeps on Discord! <3Title brainstormed up by snakesandladders <3$f$, 5257, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:38:16.352+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:38:16.369+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15730056, $f$The Rich Are F**king Us$f$, ARRAY[$f$NickelModelTales$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A young Manhattan couple are invited to the penthouse of their rich and powerful neighbors… and then they are hypnotized.$f$, 13065, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-01-23T06:07:23.094+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T06:07:23.135+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15760854, $f$The Little Merman: WangXian$f$, ARRAY[$f$MEOWMIAO$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$The Founder of Diabolism$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù - All Media$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A Little Mermaid AU with Merman!WWX and Prince!LWJ :3$f$, 5394, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:59:33.302+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:59:33.329+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15787707, $f$Bathymetry$f$, ARRAY[$f$LuckyDiceKirby$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Billie Lurk saves the Outsider, faces the Empress, and figures out how to live with her past. The Outsider arrives in Dunwall, attaches himself to the Royal Protector, and learns how to build a future. And, as always, someone wants to kill the Empress.$f$, 90657, 6, 6, true, 5, false, $f$2025-05-04T13:49:20.399+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-04T13:49:20.399+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15801801, $f$The Innkeeper And The Gentleman$f$, ARRAY[$f$Blue_Night$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Football RPF$f$, $f$Real Person Fiction$f$, $f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sequel to 'The Lord And The Teacher'.  One year after the events happening in Castle Lindelborn and Marco and Robert having fallen in love with each other, they are back in their castle to spend the summer months there. Oscar is eleven years old and a happy boy now, and he's looking forward to spending the summer with his uncle Thomas Müller and his friends in Castle Lindelborn and from the Cramerhouse.Thomas is still adjusting to his new life in Bad Bergzabern after the ten years he has spent far away, but his nephew and especially Manuel, the handsome innkeeper of the Cramerhouse, make it easy for him to settle in in the Pfälzer Forest and appreciate the beauty of his old and new home. Can he also help Manuel's young employee Marc-André and teach him reading and writing while he's living in Castle Lindelborn for the summer?$f$, 31871, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-01-23T06:06:49.033+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T06:06:49.080+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15808314, $f$The Care and Preservation of Nieces$f$, ARRAY[$f$GoldenThreads$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Sins of the Cities Series - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Even the best families have their share of growing pains. Rowley has it under control.$f$, 2228, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-02-26T12:30:58.424+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-26T12:30:58.468+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15816786, $f$The DogEared Pile: Unfinished and Abandoned Stories.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Vykyll$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dragon Age: Origins$f$, $f$Dragon Age II$f$, $f$Dragon Age: Inquisition$f$, $f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$I have a LOT of backlogged stories that I will never truly finish.Don't want them to go to waste, not being read and that.So, I'm making a  'DogEared' pile of them for you all to enjoy.
Index:Ch 1: New life, new rules: Reflected/Refracted short: The View. (Alex Knight Spoiler)Ch 2 & 3: New life, new rules: The Broken Ones. (Alt-Fenris, Spirits & Demons)Ch 4 & 5: The gentle slope of the mountain. (Alt-M!Hawke)Ch 6: Leather And Fade. (MCiT)Ch 7, 8, & 9: From these emerald waters doth life begin anew. (Dishonored/Dragon Age crossover)Ch 10, 11, 12 & beyond: The Band of Blighters. (F!Hawke & M!Morrigan)$f$, 167338, 18, 18, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-30T21:25:33.478+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T21:25:33.613+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15828675, $f$Divergencia de caminos$f$, ARRAY[$f$Vismur$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Colección de drabbles. Contando sobre Lan Wangji y su misteriosa esposa.$f$, 2116, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:15:37.760+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:15:37.786+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15835131, $f$Corsets and Con Games (Devil in a Blue Dress Mix)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Isis$f$, $f$Prinzenhasserin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Am I not the Thorn of Camorr?  Am I not a master of disguise?”“Master, yes,” said Jean.  “Not a mistress.”$f$, 3598, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-05-27T02:09:16.786+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-27T02:09:16.977+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15841593, $f$My Immortal$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jaywalker_Holmes$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei WuXian had thought his troubles had ended after the mess with Jin GuangYao was sorted out, and that he would spend the rest of his life happily with his beloved Lan Zhan, double cultivating and rebuilding his golden core. However, fate had other plans. Mo XuanYu's frail body could not contain his increasing power, and an inevitable cultivation accident occurs, sending Wei WuXian to his six-year old body, just before Jiang FengMian found him. Will the YiLing Patriarch have a happier life this time around? Inspired by Evanescence's song, which will be reflected in the chapter titles.$f$, 44330, 20, 20, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-23T13:22:53.510+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T13:22:53.521+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15849879, $f$Red$f$, ARRAY[$f$Laxruar$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jiang Cheng inflicts, Wei Wuxian breaks and Lan WangJi just wants to help.$f$, 70000, 20, 20, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:26:47.365+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:26:47.386+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15861123, $f$A Wild Call and a Clear Call$f$, ARRAY[$f$Oko (tucuxi)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hiram Kalloway joined the naval service at the late age of thirteen, his mother having insisted on him remaining home until that age in order to gain some additional polish.Over the years, Hiram gained a reputation for being an odd, bookish sort, but a fair enough captain who fought like a devil and read the sea like a lover, and kept to himself for the most part. Hiram knew he had a good reputation, as these things went, but also rather a peculiar one. He swam, because he liked it, which was considered very odd, and he did not eat jellied desserts, because he did not like them. He detested any number of naval practices that were standard on other ships, and turned a blind eye to others, and as a result he had been called an odd duck more than once.And that was all fine, until he met Isaac Upton, a ship's master with a sharp tongue and a sharper temper, a man who seemed willing to castigate any and all members of the Admiralty who were inclined to cheat his captain, regardless of their power or influence.$f$, 14665, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2025-05-04T14:01:13.395+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-04T14:01:13.396+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15873060, $f$Cover Me With Roses$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Bruno Buccellati, former child actor, wakes up one morning convinced his life has gone completely out of control. He's right, and he doesn't even know how right he is.$f$, 4001, 1, 3, false, 3, false, $f$2019-01-06T17:21:54.168+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-06T17:21:54.246+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15890703, $f$the killing moon (by any other name remix)$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$, $f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Imagine the worst fate that could befall you, or those you loved best. It would not be death, for all who are born are fated to die. That was not the worst fate -- it was a normal one. A beginning necessitates an ending, a start to a stop. Think instead, of non-existence, or a death that was not so, a death that was incomplete.$f$, 1840, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-01-11T12:34:53.998+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-11T12:34:54.050+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15896169, $f$let the gods speak softly of us$f$, ARRAY[$f$erlkoenig$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$TOLKIEN J. R. R. - Works & Related Fandoms$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He looks up at Balan, looks at him long and hard. All the lines and wrinkles, the fading freckles and the white of his hair, the loose skin at his throat and all the many things that time has touched, has taken and changed. All these changes and yet he is still his Balan, his Bëor, still the man he fell in love with so many years ago. Still as handsome, still as lovely and wonderful, and time cannot take that from him, for all that it has taken and all that it will take.$f$, 3338, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-30T11:55:57.612+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-30T11:55:57.665+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15903273, $f$Stones for the weary$f$, ARRAY[$f$Whaler$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Outsider got his life back, but nothing in this world is for free. Especially if even you don't know yourself."Because if you can choose for a purpose, you will choose carefully. Like I chose a man I find joy in… Like if you want to make a god, one that lives forever and can form this world as he likes, you won’t choose just anyone – not a random kid from the streets.”$f$, 71631, 6, 8, false, -1, false, $f$2019-05-31T11:57:04.006+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-31T11:57:04.105+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15910149, $f$a blanket of red$f$, ARRAY[$f$Nevospitanniy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$You touched me inside of my cage
  
  Beneath my shirt your hands embraced me
  
  Come to me feathered and frayed
  
  For I am the ugliest prey
 *It’s odd: they aren’t friends. The Outsider could barely be considered a business partner, the one Emily had inherited from her father. And yet, there’s no one who knows the tapestry of their collective pain better than him; after all, he’d seen every stitch and put more that a couple in himself.$f$, 8944, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-23T03:33:40.426+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T03:33:40.463+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15920064, $f$Pestilenza$f$, ARRAY[$f$addledwalrus$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Black Death spreads through Europe and the Middle East, forever changing the lives of several individuals.$f$, 4104, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-01-23T06:04:30.149+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T06:04:30.185+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15933308, $f$Visitor from the Void$f$, ARRAY[$f$jeannedarcprice$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Beware The Outsider. When you are at your weakest He will seek after you and ensnare you.Keep your heart closed to the Void.For He with the dark eyes is a trickster. - A warning from the deathbed of an unknown follower of The Outsider.$f$, 921, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:31:12.924+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:31:12.995+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15949844, $f$Don't Close Eyes$f$, ARRAY[$f$Deborah_Dasheen$f$, $f$Gianeya$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Who you watch in the bathtub is none of my concern.” Corvo’s words keep echoing to Piero. Interesting, what would he say, if he found out that Piero was not peeping on Callista, but him?$f$, 1384, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-01T04:09:12.329+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T04:09:12.383+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15949931, $f$别闭眼$f$, ARRAY[$f$Deborah_Dasheen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“你偷窥什么人洗澡不关我事。”Corvo的话语时常在Piero耳边回响。有趣的是，如果Corvo发现Piero在偷窥的并不是Callista而是他，他会说些什么呢？$f$, 2116, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-30T21:26:47.295+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T21:26:47.384+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15966728, $f$Tales From the Void$f$, ARRAY[$f$bluebeholder$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 6499, 9, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-07-15T03:16:20.602+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-15T03:16:20.687+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15988805, $f$a thousand years$f$, ARRAY[$f$bluebeholder$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Every thousand years, a man is born, and every thousand years, the Outsider meets him once again. Reincarnation is a funny thing, when you're a god who never dies.$f$, 1951, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-05-01T04:04:06.572+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T04:04:06.636+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15991097, $f$no other cloud compares to you$f$, ARRAY[$f$ectocosme$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$The Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Divine beasts sometimes fall in love with humans. Half-divine beast most often than not. Dragons always. Wei Wuxian visits Cloud Recesses when he receives the first 'hail' of who will become his mate. At least, he is determined for them to become mates.But life does not flow as the river, it is a meandering stream easily disturbed.$f$, 106836, 32, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-22T17:48:29.282+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T17:48:29.327+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 15997529, $f$Home$f$, ARRAY[$f$MEVaughan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 4110, 3, 4, false, 1, false, $f$2018-12-26T00:24:54.810+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-26T00:24:54.815+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16007708, $f$Like the clouds for the moon.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Justanothersinger$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$'Five kingdoms used to stand, with bated breaths alongside their fellow man. One kingdom drenched with the blood of war, two kingdoms, side by side, friends in power, one kingdom, with bared fangs and tongue, poisoned words, half-truths about the swords they herd and one kingdom, quietly withdrawn from the world, in the light of recent events unfurled. Or at least, that was how it should be.The First Prince and Princess of Yunmeng, stranded in the lands of Gusu beyond the barrier, and the beloved troublemaker that brought them there, somehow, against all odds, find themselves at the heart of a scheme, years in the making and in the heart of bonds, of romances that shake the very core of the kingdoms they stand for.'aka the Royal A/B/O AU with Wangxian and Xicheng, along with unresolved sexual tension resolved by fighting or making out(or both), political conflicts, dumb teenagers being dumb, bad comedy, fighting zombies and maybe a few costume changes along the way i gotta hit all those guilty pleasure kinks man$f$, 46855, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:34:28.258+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:34:28.269+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16023671, $f$So Musical A Discord$f$, ARRAY[$f$Erradianwhocantread$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$The Lord of the Rings - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Song inspired mini-fics from my tumblr$f$, 12965, 26, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-07-31T11:06:39.548+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T11:06:39.618+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16079258, $f$Castling$f$, ARRAY[$f$lieutenant_hatshepsut$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Корво - божество, Чужой - человек, оказавшийся не в то время не в том месте.$f$, 1640, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-30T21:26:08.842+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T21:26:08.924+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16088492, $f$Mo XuanYu Deserves Happiness$f$, ARRAY[$f$Daddy Jiang Cheng (gotaemin)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Small scene about the ambiguous time when Mo XuanYu was part of the LanLingJin sect and bothered Jin GuangYao a lot that the author never really touched on. I want him to be happy while still sticking to canon BUT I WANT HIM TO BE HAPPY OK$f$, 1180, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-03T17:24:31.825+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T17:24:31.860+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16111208, $f$Sleeping Beauty$f$, ARRAY[$f$ravewriter$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A king finds little sleeping beauty fifty years before the end of her term. He thinks she's a sex doll, but probably wouldn't care if she were real.$f$, 1155, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-01-22T05:38:00.091+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-22T05:38:00.139+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16118126, $f$what do you mean this goes in that$f$, ARRAY[$f$nanthebread$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Yes, Gusu Lan’s education is top-notch, heads and shoulders above every other cultivation sect...but have you ever considered these poor boys need a little more practical knowledge? I think it’d be a good idea to implement sex ed!”Lan Qiren was torn between having a cardiac event then and there or sending Wei Wuxian into the afterlife once more, preferably with his own two hands.$f$, 10491, 5, 6, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:27:25.832+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:27:25.864+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16131281, $f$Out of the Spotlight$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$, $f$WahlBuilder$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Corvo is an old rocker, and Levi is a man with an ethereal voice and past in an emo hardcore band. They find each other in a small club on the outskirts of the city, and music does its magic to bring two different souls closer.
A tumblr prompt for a modern au.$f$, 2060, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-01T04:03:34.305+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T04:03:34.365+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16134659, $f$a sweetness old and new and rare$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$All Findaráto wants is to escape Nargothrond for a day with Balan, away from the politics and the pettiness and everything else. And when they finally make their escape, it is all so, so worth the hassle.$f$, 2057, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-30T03:46:38.361+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-30T03:46:38.419+00:00$f$, $f$2018-09-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16189658, $f$31 Autumn Days$f$, ARRAY[$f$ScalyshArc$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$The Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$October Writing Prompts 2018. Writing Prompts by Mia Botha at writerwrite. Kumpulan ficlet dengan berbagai pair dan cita rasa, karena kita butuh gula untuk menangkal pahit-pahit yang akan datang. ((Edit : ga jadi isi gula semua, otak saya kebanyakan kafein jadi lebih banyak pahit uhukmaaf lupa tulis, akan ada beberapa spoiler chapter 90an ke atas))Chapter 31 : AU Canon divergence. Sebelum Yiling-laozu lahir kembali...$f$, 15477, 31, 31, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:16:00.266+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:16:00.279+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16191635, $f$Lullaby$f$, ARRAY[$f$SteelLily$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The trolley full of beer was hurdling toward Lucille at an alarming rate and showed no signs of stopping. Before Valerie Dyer had even consciously made the decision, she found herself between Lucille and the runaway alcohol. Val caught the look of absolute horror on Lucille’s face right before the cart slammed into her. The last thing Val was able to process before passing out was Lucille shouting into the Black Sail for Val’s aunt to telephone for an ambulance.$f$, 1696, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-06-01T20:41:33.362+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T20:41:33.364+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16212158, $f$Both Master and His Dear Disciple are Clueless at the Path of Love$f$, ARRAY[$f$Fyon_Pyong$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After the siege of the Burial Mounds led by his beloved ShiDi, the Yiling Patriarch Wei WuXian was spared by the Heavens before death welcomed him. Instead of having his body perish from the world for good, the souls of the past from the Burial Mounds saved him and hid his body to the lonely village of Mo, where he met his first disciple, Mo XuanYu, the lunatic cut-sleeve.After 13 years of having roamed the world with his beloved disciple as a travelling apothecary, the duo stumbled upon the mysterious ghost hand that has been terrorizing the Mo Village. Where the strange turn of events instigated the current investigation. However, Heavens’ Will was a fickle thing. Even with the numerous routes that Fate has laid out for him and all of his old acquaintances, Wei WuXian realized that no matter in what world he was in, Lan WangJi will always be there with him. Too bad, our Patriarch was too blind to see it.$f$, 23094, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-02T04:24:14.633+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-02T04:24:14.652+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16214687, $f$Close to Your Heart$f$, ARRAY[$f$amyfortuna$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Bëor and Finrod arrive in Nargothrond. It's full of Elves.$f$, 978, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-30T03:50:29.403+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-30T03:50:29.435+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16216883, $f$Sing Me A Song$f$, ARRAY[$f$Delusional_Lunatic_3791$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$Strange Magic (2015)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wedding bells are ringing on the day Amarië and Finrod are to be joined in holy matrimone. At least, that's what's supposed to happen…$f$, 2874, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-07-31T03:35:44.525+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T03:35:44.569+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16232912, $f$To a certain degree$f$, ARRAY[$f$NowSeeHere$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Delia sets up a meeting for Valerie to meet the new nurse Lucille for drinks over happy hour. Things get off to a bumpy start, but they work out in the end.$f$, 3866, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-06-03T23:24:03.403+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-03T23:24:03.405+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16235909, $f$After$f$, ARRAY[$f$EHyde$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$Discworld - Terry Pratchett$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After Mo Xuanyu summons Wei Wuxian, he has one final encounter.$f$, 382, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:48:01.207+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:48:01.248+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16241288, $f$To Deserve So Much More$f$, ARRAY[$f$renysen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo XuanYu was a little too late to getting Wei WuXian's soul. A civilian family never expected to be under siege by an army and their youngest daughter happens upon a treasure niche where old writings of bringing back the dead have been recorded. In the effort to save her family, she sacrifices her soul and brings forth Wei WuXian. Armed with a powerful Golden Core and a female body, Wei WuXian has to deal with the increasing number of cultivators that want to learn from the powerful cultivator that can destroy entire armies single-handedly, more so cultivators that want to marry "her".Meanwhile, Wei WuXian thinks husband hunting would be a lot easier if he didn’t have to pick anyone.$f$, 19909, 5, 5, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:40:28.369+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:40:28.392+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16251128, $f$Unwind Me, Untether Me$f$, ARRAY[$f$KayNight$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Castlevania (Cartoon)$f$, $f$悪魔城ドラキュラ | Castlevania Series$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sometimes Trevor just needs to be held down, fucked out of his mind, and given a little bit of love. Alucard is happy to oblige.$f$, 1328, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2018-11-17T13:10:35.135+00:00$f$, $f$2018-11-17T13:10:35.215+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16255694, $f$Break Me (so you can piece me back together again)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Ticktocktheclock (tashatj)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There is much more than meets the eye.$f$, 4812, 2, 5, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:17:08.522+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:17:08.566+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16255898, $f$An Insufferable God$f$, ARRAY[$f$bluebeholder$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$During his time in Karnaca, Corvo sneaks into a secret room to retrieve a rune from a shrine. Of course the Outsider can't let this pass without a comment...or two...or perhaps a monologue. He's insufferable, and the only solution to that problem is to kiss him.$f$, 1126, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-06T16:58:32.109+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-06T16:58:32.147+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16276910, $f$I’ve Found My Place, I’m Safe and Sound$f$, ARRAY[$f$dynamicsymmetry$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Emily Kaldwin is on the throne, Dunwall is rebuilding, and Corvo Attano desperately wants to move on. Of course he can’t. Of course when he tries he finds himself moving in some absolutely horrifying directions.$f$, 19611, 7, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-04-26T09:42:12.009+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-26T09:42:12.089+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16294982, $f$Blink$f$, ARRAY[$f$Menuridae$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“So on Saturday night, while you are having the time of your life on a date with your hot, hunky, handsome soulmate, I have to go on a date with a rich young master who sounds like a literal stick in the mud whilst pretending to be you?"
 
Mo Xuanyu's family has set him up on a blind date with a rich young master after learning he is gay. However, he already has plans for that night. Instead of going on the date himself, Mo Xuanyu enlists Wei Wuxian to go as a substitute. Wei Wuxian must act like his best friend for the night before kindly turning down Mo Xuanyu's date.
Only, Wei Wuxian finds out that turning down Mo Xuanyu's date is possibly the hardest thing he has had to do in a long time.
Russian Translation now available.$f$, 79174, 10, 10, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:13:00.465+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:13:00.490+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16317368, $f$North Star in Somebody's Sky$f$, ARRAY[$f$Devin Cage (shiny_silver_socks)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There was no use lusting after Colin, no matter how delectable he looked after spending a day working in the sun. That ship had sailed more than a decade ago, with Colin on it and Reggie at home with a broken heart.$f$, 1616, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-23T03:04:04.785+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T03:04:05.140+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16333052, $f$A Different Sleeping Beauty$f$, ARRAY[$f$Azides$f$, $f$ravewriter$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A king stumbles onto a different sleeping beauty. It's not what the boy's father had in mind.$f$, 2881, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-01-22T05:38:20.192+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-22T05:38:20.243+00:00$f$, $f$2018-10-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16352579, $f$Об одобренных техниках воскрешения$f$, ARRAY[$f$Firoy (nadin_hime)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Пара слов об эксперементальных практиках, которые доведут любых темных магистров до слез. Постканон, серия драбблов, где у всех все хорошо.$f$, 1788, 2, 2, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:13:23.327+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:13:23.349+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16355975, $f$Discord in Mortality$f$, ARRAY[$f$vanitasmemoire$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Before Wei WuXian’s death, he hopes for the day that he and Lan Zhan can love each other again without any conflicts that will endanger them. Yet, the heavens are still punishing him after all these years.It’s as if history was repeated, everything was once again the same but good news the Wen Sect no longer exists so there won’t be any upcoming war. Everything is in picture but there’s an empty spot in the middle. He wonders until now where he is. Lan Wangji doesn’t want his sufferings to be repeated too, he wished that they will be reunited in their next life but it seems the world doesn’t want to.Until he saw that figure in black robes, flute in one hand and long hair swaying with the wind and those dead eyes staring in the distance. Lan Wangji knew that the heavens didn’t punished Wei WuXian… they saved him.$f$, 6837, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:32:28.197+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:32:28.223+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
