($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16443623, $f$Lotus in the Palace$f$, ARRAY[$f$CountingSheep$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Right after winning a war, General Wei WuXian has a rude awakening as an omega and is dragged to the imperial palace.  While he gets used to his new place in society, he begins to reconnect with his family and old friends--one of which is an ice-cold Emperor who is as hard to read as ever.$f$, 127427, 35, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-22T14:32:12.544+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T14:32:12.582+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
