($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16484438, $f$Hiding Place$f$, ARRAY[$f$Moon_Lovers_Lover$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jingyi only realizes that he’s staring when Sect Leader Jiang turns to look back at him with narrowed eyes and an annoyed expression. Jingyi gulps but can’t look away. Their eyes meet, and Jingyi panics.And then he realizes that he’s been pouring hot water on his boots for the past five seconds, panics more, and manages to brush the teapot, teacups, and tray crashing to the floor with the edge of his sleeve.Edit: GUYS STOP WHAT YOU'RE DOING AND LOOK AT THIS ART THAT KEY DREW FOR THIS STORY - IT'S BEAUTIFUL AND I DIE FROM HAPPINESS WHENEVER I LOOK AT IT: http://keysmash.tumblr.com/post/180584585034/i-finally-drew-jiang-cheng-and-lan-jingyi-from-oneALSO YALL GOTTA LOOK AT THIS ONE TOO WO DE TIAN HOLY SHIT: https://www.instagram.com/p/BrpxuQrl3I5/?utm_source=ig_share_sheet&igshid=105t5y1o9e9vk$f$, 25828, 10, 10, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-23T13:25:07.236+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T13:25:07.266+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[])
